(SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
(This specification covers electrical works for sewage treatment plant including motors) Tj T*
(and panels complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SITE CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(- The equipment shall be designed for a maximum ambient temperature of 40 deg C.) Tj T*
(- Relative humidity at site may reach 95%.) Tj T*
(- The installation is at an altitude of less than 1000 m above mean sea level.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 4: MAIN LT PANEL) Tj T*
(- The LT panel shall conform to IS/IEC 61439-1:2020 and IS/IEC 61439-2:2020.) Tj T*
(- The panel shall be cubicle type, floor mounted, fabricated from CRCA sheet steel of) Tj T*
(2mm thickness.) Tj T*
(- The rated operational voltage shall be 415V, 3 phase, 4 wire, 50Hz.) Tj T*
(- Main busbars shall be of electrolytic grade aluminium rated for 1600A continuous) Tj T*
(current. The busbars and panel shall withstand a short circuit current of 50 kA for 1) Tj T*
(second.) Tj T*
(- The degree of protection of the panel enclosure shall be IP54.) Tj T*
(- The switchboard shall have Form 3b internal separation.) Tj T*
(- Incomers shall be 1600A, 4 pole, electrically operated air circuit breakers conforming) Tj T*
(to IS/IEC 60947-2:2003.) Tj T*
(- Outgoing feeders shall be MCCBs with ultimate breaking capacity of 36 kA.) Tj T*
(- Multifunction meters of accuracy class 0.5 shall be provided on each incomer.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
