(GUARANTEED TECHNICAL PARTICULARS — LT PANEL) Tj T*
(Rated voltage: 415V) Tj T*
(Rated current of main busbar: 1600A) Tj T*
(Short time current rating: 50 kA for 1 s) Tj T*
(Degree of protection: IP54) Tj T*
(Make and type: \(to be furnished by the bidder\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — DRIVE MOTORS) Tj T*
(- Motors shall be squirrel cage induction motors conforming to IS 325:1996.) Tj T*
(- The rated output of the motor shall be 37kW. Motors shall be suitable for 415V ± 10%,) Tj T*
(50Hz ± 5%, 3 phase supply.) Tj T*
(- Motors shall be of efficiency class IE3 as per IS 12615:2018.) Tj T*
(- Degree of protection of the motor enclosure shall be IP55. Motors shall have class F) Tj T*
(insulation with temperature rise limited to class B and shall be suitable for S1 duty.) Tj T*
(- Synchronous speed of the motor shall be 1500 RPM.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART F — LT POWER AND CONTROL CABLES) Tj T*
(- Power cables shall be 1.1 kV grade, aluminium conductor, XLPE insulated, armoured and) Tj T*
(PVC sheathed, conforming to IS 7098 \(Part 1\):1988.) Tj T*
(- The main feeder cable shall be 3.5 core 300 sq mm.) Tj T*
(- The cables shall be suitable for a maximum continuous conductor temperature of 90 deg) Tj T*
(C.) Tj T*
(- Control cables shall be PVC insulated, copper conductor of 2.5 sq mm, 1.1 kV grade,) Tj T*
(conforming to IS 1554 \(Part 1\).) Tj T*
(- Conductors shall be stranded, class 2, conforming to IS 8130.) Tj T*
(- Cables shall be laid in RCC trenches or on perforated cable trays as shown in the) Tj T*
(drawings.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
